\section{What the tests of \code{submit.sh} do not prove}{

The tests drive the generated \code{submit.sh} with stub \code{hostname}, \code{sinfo},
\code{squeue} and \code{sbatch} programs on \code{PATH}. So they prove the shell branching
against a protocol the tests wrote. Four things stay unproven.
